resources.string:
The runner runs along one of three tracks. Your goal: don't crash and collect as many coins as you can.

Controls:
• swipe left / right - move to the next track;
• swipe up - jump (over the low red barrier);
• swipe down - roll (under the high yellow barrier).

Obstacles:
• 🚧 low barrier - jump over;
• 🚧 high barrier - roll under;
• 🚆 train - you can't jump it, move to a free track. You can't run into its side either.

Coins: every 10 coins collected = 1 messenger coin 🪙 (the remainder carries over between runs).

Power-ups:
• 🧲 magnet - coins fly to you for 10 s;
• 🛹 board - 15 s, one crash is forgiven;
• ✖2 - double score for 12 s;
• 👟 super jump - higher, longer jumps for 10 s (with a flip);
• 🛡 shield - saves you from one crash or stumble;
• 💰 coins ×2 - every coin counts twice;
• ⏳ slow motion - the world runs slower.
While you fly on the jetpack, the board and sneakers don't run down. Rolling on a board - the runner lies down on it.

Speed grows over time. Score - for distance and coins; the best result is saved. Tap the screen to start; Back or minimising pauses.
